// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Spanish game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf), using the names of the
// official Spanish (Spain) release (ELG, Centro de mando, Tormenta SCUD, Cañón de partículas, ...).
// The interface addresses the player as "tú"; EVA, officers and enemy generals use "usted" and
// "general". Multiplayer map names stay in English. Includes legacy labels for older game data.
// Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py. See languages/README.md before editing.

